Serve the last live model catalog as the managed-sandbox new-session preview.

Subscription CLI logins have no server-side model listing, so the Kubernetes
sandbox picker shows "Models unavailable" until a session is running. Record the
catalog each runner reports per harness in OMNIGENT_SANDBOX_CATALOG_FALLBACK_PATH
and return it from /v1/sandbox-providers/{p}/harnesses/{h}/model-options.
Inert unless that variable is set. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

